re  and so they became dependent on billy  bob's water but hey it's a great deal so  they're not complaining billy bob founds  the bill and robert agricultural company  and starts buying out all the land plots  around einville his tactics are the same  offer the owners generous terms and  occasionally high position and lucrative  salary if billy bob deems the owner to  be a potential valuable addition to his  team that is and so most landowners end  up taking his offer and those who  initially don't are either swayed by  secret deals where billboard offers them  a price well above market or by  threatening with accident squad and gold  happening to the pipes that feed those  particular plots one way or another  billy bob ends up owning all the land  plots around town satisfying his growing  urge for ownership and control for the  time being anyway and because of his  great public business practices nobody  opposes him everybody wants to see him  succeed he's a great manager a  benefactor of prodigies and his cheap  high quality water helps the local  industry supporting breweries  distilleries a paper mill and even a  paint factory his success is everyone  else's success and einville is booming  because of him a true great man he is  but the success begins to draw some  shady characters into the area raider  gangs from the abandoned areas in the  south start harassing the town the  townsfolk organized into a militia and  managed to fend off the attackers but  just barely dozens die to gunshot wounds  and the townsfolk come together on the  main square to honor the dead at the  ceremony billy bob delivers a speech  lamenting their heroic sacrifice he ends  his speech by announcing the foundation  of a permanent security force under his  control to defend the town so that  nothing like this will happen ever again  anyone can enlist the gear and training  are provided together with free company  housing and a good salary a few months  later blackwater security already has a  hundred members who aside from guarding  the perimeters also patrol inside  einville to keep up the order that way  people no longer have to bother with  organizing militias and neighborhood  watches and have more time to spend  freely the next raider attack gets  repelled much easier thanks to the  organized semi-professional defense  force though casualties are minimal the  raiders manage to do significant damage  to certain parts of the town billy bob  wants to pay for the reconstruction out  of his own pocket announcing his  intentions in front of a cheering crowd  he also suggests building a defensive  structure around the town which he would  gladly help finance but most of the  money would come from people's pockets  at first not everyone is on board with  the idea but in a few months following  raiders sightings and a massive pro war  campaign which appears to be grassroots  but is financed completely by billy pup  from the shadows the public opinion  shifts and the wall gets built around  einvale the town becomes completely safe  which gives a boost to its economy and  draws in a lot of people from all around  the area who move in for that safety and  stability soon enough ironville almost  doubles in population thanks to its  appeal and the generously low rent  prices offered by the pidlin robot real  estate company which aside from  apartments also builds a massive  fortification at the center of the town  as billbop's pet project it's an added  second line of defense that people can  retreat to in case the war got breached  this added security draws in even more  people and consequently causes  significant appreciation in property  prices everyone is in favor of building  the fort once completed billy bob moves  his entire headquarters inside it at  this point billy bob owns the water  system the land around town multiple  mines workshops foundries a huge number  of buildings in town a security force a  wall and a fort and all these are run by  the managers under him who also grow  empower and influence with him  organizing different aspects of life and  are only accountable to billy bob  personally billy bob is a great man who  has done so much for ironville and he  would like to see some more compensation  for his efforts he announces the need  for a contribution from everyone living  inside the walls to finance the upkeep  of all the defenses most people agree to  it and those who don't are offered to  move outside the walls if they refuse  blackwater security will simply evict  them now this is of course a risky move  in terms of pr so biliba proceeds to buy  up as many local news outlets as he can  or at least try to fill their ranks with  writers secretly paid by him despite his  efforts though word spreads around town  that billy bob has gone too far and  needs to be stopped still only a small  minority of the population takes part in  this the rest being more than satisfied  with their growing living standards  under billy bob anti-billy bob movements  are formed but are consequently squashed  by black water agents working with billy  bob's growing network of informants  members are tried in the blackwater  court system popularly accepted as the  biggest and most efficient body to  dispense justice in ironville over time  people inside the walls become a sort of  higher class citizenry who have access  to high quality public services in  exchange for their taxes and loyalty to  billy bob those outside the wolves don't  pay taxes but no public services are  provided to them unless they pay a hefty  quote-unquote outskirts premium and can  only be inside the town centre between  8am and 9pm those who want to move  inside the city walls won't be let in by  blackboard security unless they pay a  quote-unquote settlement premium a fee  designed to keep up the prestige of  living inside the walls those on the  outside have of course limited access to  all the jobs and opportunities on the  inside therefore they have to get by  mostly on agricultural work for which  they get russians and housing the new  unspoken rule spreads around town billy  bob will give you law and order  stability and prosperity but for that  you must pay your dues and not question  his authority under any circumstances  those who do get fined or even exiled  depending on the severity but for each  exile there are five newcomers to take  their place wanting to participate in  the stable economy and society ok  alright so what do we have here a  well-protected town with a fortified  administrative center outside there is a  lower class mostly working the fields  inside we have a privileged citizen  class and most aspects of life are  controlled by a sort of nobility who are  only accountable to the men above them  and of course most of everything is  owned by that man alone so through this  simulation by starting out with the most  ideal circumstances possible for an end  cap society to arise we ended up with a  sort of enlightened feudalism and why  wouldn't we you know capitalism is  fundamentally based on a government-like  hierarchy one that isn't democratic so  once you introduce a power vacuum by  ending the government it makes sense  that capitalism will fill that vacuum  but this time with a truly autocratic  structure you know i always hear these  libertarians and handcaps whine about  government tyranny and how taxes are  theft but i mean when was the last time  you had a say in how your workplace is  run hey when's the next ceo election  coming up the one you can vote in as  well as an employee not just the rich  shareholders okay so this was a lot of  fun actually and i think i'll be giving  it a second try because something must  have been wrong right henrico capitalism  can just turn into feudalism right well  don't you worry next time we'll  fine-tune the simulation of it and  experiment with some other possibilities  which are no less interesting in the  meantime thank you for watching and  please like and subscribe and also check  out my patreon link in the description  and i'll be seeing you next time  you
 

